        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ah, not sure how I missed that issue, thanks!\r\n\r\nAdding the execute_after version did solve my problem.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n  vim.keymap.set(\r\n    'n',\r\n    '<C-d>',\r\n    [[<Cmd>lua vim.cmd('normal! <C-d>'); MiniAnimate.execute_after('scroll', 'normal! zvzz')<CR>]]\r\n  )\r\n  vim.keymap.set(\r\n    'n',\r\n    '<C-u>',\r\n    [[<Cmd>lua vim.cmd('normal! <C-u>'); MiniAnimate.execute_after('scroll', 'normal! zvzz')<CR>]]\r\n  )\r\n  ```\r\n\r\nGiven how common the `<C-d>zz` rebind is maybe explicitly using this remap as an example in a section after **Installation** in the readme for **Remapping animated commands** or something of that nature would help future users.\r\n\r\nThanks again!",
            "created_at": "2023-02-15T18:41:44Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/228#issuecomment-1431839123",
