        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Adding the execute_after version did solve my problem.\r\n\r\nGreat!\r\n\r\n> Given how common the `<C-d>zz` rebind is maybe explicitly using this remap as an example in a section after **Installation** in the readme for **Remapping animated commands** or something of that nature would help future users.\r\n\r\nThis is already in the help file. But as you are not the first one with this kind of problem (and solution, even), this might be a good idea.\r\n\r\nClosing then.",
